'''Lothal Depot''',<ref name="Databank">{{Databank|lothal-depot|Lothal Depot}}</ref> also known as the '''Jalath City depot''', was a landing area near the city of [[Jalath]] on [[Lothal]], a [[planet]] in the [[Outer Rim Territories]].<ref name="A Princess on Lothal" /> Built on top of the hard surface of an ancient body of water, it was a cheap landing zone and an ideal place for larger ships to land without disrupting [[Capital City]]. In addition to the landing area, the depot was comprised of several metal warehouses, offices, and other facilities.<ref name="Dawn">''[[Dawn of Rebellion]]''</ref>

During the early rebellion against the [[Galactic Empire]], [[Princess]] [[Leia Skywalker Organa Solo|Leia Organa]] brought three [[Sphyrna-class Hammerhead corvette|''Sphyrna''-class Hammerhead corvettes]] to Lothal Depot so the rebels could steal them, thus giving [[Alderaan]] plausible deniability regarding its involvement in the rebellion. The rebels [[Mission on Lothal|raided]] Lothal Depot and successfully stole the ships.<ref name="A Princess on Lothal" />

